above the left atrium on CT.\n- Groundtruth 4 has no match.\n\n</diagnostic_comparison>\n```json\n{\n  \"matching_dict\": {\n    \"1\": [\n      \"The patient has a cystic mass above the left atrium on CT scan, which is a key feature of Cardiac Tumor, and also experienced cardiogenic shock, heterogeneous attenuation on CT, and contrast enhancement on CT, further supporting this diagnosis.\"\n    ],\n    \"2\": [],\n    \"3\": [\n      \"The patient has a cystic mass above the left atrium on CT scan, which is a key feature of Cardiac Tumor, and also experienced cardiogenic shock, heterogeneous attenuation on CT, and contrast enhancement on CT, further supporting this diagnosis.\"\n    ],\n    \"4\": []\n  }\n}\n```",
